fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Grants bonus {{M|attack range}} based on the caster's attack range type.

* [[File:Dota2 Templar Assassin Psi Blades Visualized icon-1.png|105px]][[File:Dota2 Templar Assassin Psi Blades Visualized icon-2.png|105px]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}}
** The total spill area-of-effect [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] is rectangular-shaped, starts from the attacked target [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] and extends behind up to point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] .
*** Hence, it can affect enemy units at max {{Code|OF + {{#var:Psi Blades value2}}}}-distance away from Lanaya's current position [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] .
**** {{Code|OF {{=}} Σ[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** The spill area {{Code|FP}} is always in front Lanaya.
**** Checks for Lanaya's current position and {{M|facing angle}} per successful attack {{M|projectile}} impact, regardless of performing attacks or {{M|denies}} on allied units or enemy units.
**** The following units are considered valid to proc the spill damage component:
***** Both {{M|allied units|x}} and {{M|enemy units|x}}.
***** {{M|Ward-type units}} with flat {{M|health}} values.
****** Applies a 0-spill damage instance to all valid enemy units when attacking {{M|ward-type units}} with a hit count, except {{U|Psionic Trap}}.

* {{Symbol|Damage|Pure}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}}
** Applies [[pure]] [[spell damage]] to the enemy units within area {{Code|FP}} upon attacking unit [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] and not on other units.
*** Hence, the spill damage is determined during Lanaya's {{M|attack point}} and is loosely defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|(Σ[[Attack Damage|AtkDmg]] × f([[Critical Strike|Crit]]) × [[After Reductions]]) × {{#var:Psi Blades value3}}}}
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Flag}}
*** The spell damage applied has the following damage flags:
**** {{M|No-spell-lifesteal}}
**** {{M|No-spell-amplification}}
** Has the following ability interactions with the following mechanics:
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} or {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Applies {{M|attack modifiers}} explicitly on the primary attacked enemy unit [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] .
**** For other enemy units within area {{Code|FP}}:
***** Interacts with after reductions-type [[damage manipulation]] sources.
***** Procs {{M|on-damage effects}}.
***** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
****** Applies all {{A|Templar Assassin|Meld}}-related debuffs onto affected enemy units within area {{Code|FP}}.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** Bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}} sources that are considered by {{M|critical strike}} sources.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Psi Blades icon0}}
| desc = Templar Assassin's psi blades slice through the attacked unit, splitting and damaging enemy units directly behind it, while gaining bonus attack range. For each unit it damages, the split damage is reduced by a percentage.
}}

