| name = Psionic Projection
| desc = [[Leash]] sources prevent the ability cast.<br><br>Does not interrupt while already {{M|channeling}}, but prevents the {{M|teleport}} component from being applied to Lanaya once the channel completes.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Templar Assasin Psionic Projection
| desc = Requires drafting {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{A|Templar Assassin|Psionic Trap}} to unlock this ability.
}}

 {{Teleportcard}}

* Acquiring {{M|Aghanim's Scepter}} unlocks this ability in the {{Spellslot|5|6}}.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** {{Symbol|Channeling|f}}
**** If the [[channeling]] is interrupted, the ability does nothing, and goes into {{M|cooldown}} while consuming {{M|mana}}.
*** {{Symbol|Channeling|t}}
***# {{M|Teleports}} Lanaya to the nearest {{U|Psionic Trap}}'s coordinates from the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location.
***#* Does not {{M|disjoint}} incoming {{M|projectiles}}.
***#* Does not break {{A|Templar Assassin|Meld}}'s {{M|invisibility}} upon cast, but not other invisibility sources.
***# Activates the corresponding {{U|Psionic Trap}}.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**# Psionic Projection's {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# The {{A|Templar Assassin|Trap}}'s charged-up {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**#* Applies a 0-damage instance in the {{M|combat log}} if the trap is not fully charged-up.
**# {{A|Templar Assassin|Psionic Projection}}
**#* The {{M|movement speed}} slow.
**#* {{Symbol|Silence}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[silence]]}}
**# The {{A|Templar Assassin|Trap}}'s current charged-up-related debuffs.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Psionic Projection icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Allows Templar Assassin to teleport to any Psionic Trap after channeling for 2 seconds, detonating it upon arrival as if it was fully charged and instantly dealing 400 bonus damage. Channeling Psionic Projection does not break Meld.
}}
* {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
** Utilizes [[forced movement]] to move Lanaya once the {{M|channeling}} completes, instead of moving her from one coordinate to another.
** Hence, Lanaya can interact with {{M|item}} shops within the shopkeeper radius.

