 * This ability is unlocked in the {{Spellslot|4|6}} upon learning {{A|Templar Assassin|Psionic Trap}} and always stays active.
** {{M|Alt-Cast}} is disabled by default upon learning the ability.

* {{Symbol|a|Sub}}
** The [[sub-ability]] has the following properties:
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** Does not interrupt Lanaya's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
*** Cannot be cast when there are no {{U|Psionic Trap|text=Psionic Traps}} present.
** {{Symbol|a|up}}
*** All ability values increases incrementally per {{M|server tick}} from the min value to the max value, and has the following properties: 
**** Increases the total {{M|movement speed}} slow by {{#expr:({{#explode:{{#var:Trap value6}}|%}}-{{#explode:{{#var:Trap value5}}|%}})/{{#var:Trap value3}}*{{G|tick rate}} round3}}% per interval.
**** {{cf|aghnotes}}
***** Increased the total {{M|silence}} duration by {{ValueColor||{{#expr:({{#var:Trap type2 value2 agh}}-{{#var:Trap type2 value1 agh}})/{{#var:Trap value3}}*{{G|tick rate}} round3}}|agh}}-second per interval.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The trap's outer ring visually appears white from black once it is fully charged.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Damage|Magical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}}
*#* The [[magical]] [[spell damage]] is only applied once the {{U|Psionic Trap}} is fully charged.
*#** Applies a 0-damage instance in the {{M|combat log}} whenever the Trap is not fully charged.
*#** Deals {{calc|v1/{{#var:Trap value7}}*{{#var:Trap basic1}}|v1={{#var:Trap value4}}}} spell damage within the radius in {{#var:Trap basic1}}-second intervals, starting {{#var:Trap basic1}} seconds upon debuff application, over {{#expr:{{#var:Trap value7}}/{{#var:Trap basic1}}}} damage instances.
*#* The damage value is calculated either the {{M|sub-ability}} cast or the ability cast on the unit.
*#** Hence, both leveling up the ability and the {{ValueColor||damage increasing|10tal}} {{M|talent|t=t1l}} immediately updates the damage value all current traps.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|templar_assassin_trap_slow}}
*# {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{Symbol|Silence}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[silence]]}}

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
** Reapplying any debuff component refreshes its duration, and updates all ability values corresponding to the Trap's current charge-up time.

